ter:"Maybe later",h142:"Search restaurants by name from the header · Your rank character now stands on your location · Chip rows no longer get cut off · Share your challenge: it shows as “Challenging now” on the map and others can tap your nickname to send cheers and one-line tips (no chat or meetups) · Spicy Shop: earn points by tips and cheers and dress up your character (glasses, neckwear, pets, auras — with a curtain reveal) · Conquest map: places you CLEARed glow gold (swap with the heat map) · Renamed to Maeul Map License",h141:"Ads in the list and Spicy News sit still in a fixed spot · Cuter sounds · Take the food photo when you start · Quick taste rating · Soft background music · Link sharing for TikTok, Instagram, Threads and blogs (AI-checked) · CLEAR with your own video (code) · Warriors by region · Everyone starts as Spice Beginner — rank up by CLEARs, tips and posts · Business-card PDF license · Newest videos first · Store phone number and booking button",h14:'First-run welcome — Professor Chili and a five-question survey · Spicy type (4 letters, like MBTI) and passives · License ceremony and nickname · Challenge flow (arrive → challenge → proof photo, or a reason if you fail) · Leave a tip right after your proof photo · Spicy News shows "Nickname (Grade) succeeded!!" · My license (card, next grade, challenge record)',myTaste:"How did it taste? (just a little)",taste3:"😋 Tasty",taste2:"🙂 Okay",taste1:"😐 So-so",visitorTaste:"Visitors on taste 😋 Tasty {pct}% · {n} people",noTaste:"🌶 Leave a few words for spice beginners. How hot it was helps the most — a little about the taste is welcome too.",anonWarrior:"An anonymous spice warrior",stArrive:"Arrive",stArrived:"Arrived at {at}",stArriveAuto:"Checks in automatically within 50 m of the place",stArriveBtn:"Check in",stTry:"Challenge · photo",stTryHint:"You can start once you have arrived",stTryReady:"Tap when the food arrives — you take the food photo right away",stTrying:"Challenging · {m} min",stTryBtn:"Start",stShot:"Result",stShotHint:"Finished it? Tap success. Stopped? Tap fail.",winBtn:"Success! I finished it",loseBtn:"Didn't make it",winSay:"{who}, you made it!!",lastFail:"Last try: failed · {why} · {d}",loseTitle:"Where did it stop you?",loseHint:"A short note helps the next challenger. It goes to Spicy News anonymously.",losePh:"One line (up to 40 characters)",loseSend:"Record the failure",fc_tooHot:"Too hot",fc_tooMuch:"Too much food",fc_stomach:"Stomach trouble",fc_time:"Ran out of time",fc_other:"Other",e_arrive_first:"You need to arrive at the place before starting",e_no_permission:'Location permission is needed. Tap "Check in" to allow it',fWin:"{who} succeeded!!",fFail:"{who} just missed it",isBurning:"Firing up your license…",isStyle:"Your spicy type",isPassive:"Passives",isHidden:"Hidden",isLucky:"Lucky",isNickAsk:"Spice warrior, may we ask what nickname to engrave on your license?",isNickHint:'Up to 12 characters · shown in Spicy News as "Nickname (Grade)" · you can change it later',isNickPh:"Nickname",isNickOk:"Engrave this name",isNickSkip:"Maybe later",isNext:"Next",isGot:"Get my license",heatLv:"Heat level {n}",styleLbl:"Type",passiveLbl:"Passives",nickEdit:"Change nickname",fastNote:"Head-on + Steel type bonus — half the successes needed",styleTest:"Find my spicy type",myListTitle:"My challenge list",myToTry:"To challenge",myCleared:"Cleared",clearedOn:"Cleared {d}",failedOn:"Failed {d}",wTitle:"{area} warriors · {n}",wHint:"Warriors who took on or rated a place here in the last 90 days. Each person is counted once.",wCount:"{n}",ownOpen:"🎬 CLEAR with my own video or post (creators)",ownTitle:"CLEAR with my own video or post",ownStep1:"Put my code below in your video description, blog post or TikTok/Instagram caption and save (editing an old post works too).",ownStep2:"Paste the link and tap Check.",ownStep3:"If the code is there and it is about this place — CLEAR! You can remove the code afterwards.",ownCopy:"Copy",ownCopied:"Code copied",ownCh